  "question": "Where\u2019s the closest restaurant along the travel direction toward West Chester Cardiology, West Chester, PA?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-75.153583 39.935532)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-75.599564 39.969582)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'restaurant'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-75.153583 39.935532)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-75.153583 39.935532)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
